<http://data.silknow.org/object/96d850c5-29e2-3585-b1d9-133edebf7545/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Dress fabric of woven silk and wool in plain weave.\nThe main stripe, 2 cm wide, has a white ground with a very fine delicate blue stem meander bearing green leaves edged in blue, floral sprays in pink or blue with yellow details and pink flowers. This stripe is edged each side by a narrow blue band with single diagonal leaves forming flattened Z-shapes in pink  edged in white. There is evidence of a pink or light red ground on  both outer sides.\nWarp: white, brown, grey and red silk.\nWeft: white and pink silk, both Z-twist; blue, green and yellow wool, all Z-twist."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/96d850c5-29e2-3585-b1d9-133edebf7545> .

